Data notice:
  * Market layer — built from public U.S. government and GLEIF data: HMDA (CFPB/FFIEC), FDIC BankFind and
    financials, SBA 7(a)/504 FOIA (public domain), GLEIF LEI data (CC0 1.0). Those sources keep their own
    terms; this notice covers the code, the schema and the compiled graph.
  * Bank layer — entirely synthetic. "Banking-KG Bank", its customers and its competitors are fictional.
    Any resemblance to a real person or institution is coincidental.
